==Battleground==
*2 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Scissoroo]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Super Metal Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Croconator]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**5 [[Croconator]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**5 [[Croconator]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**5 [[Croconator]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A decent critical hitter is absolutely required here, a meatshield to bait Scissoroo attacks is highly recommended.

